@api = http://localhost:5080

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Week 2 exit test: the full booking flow, including every failure case.
### Run these top to bottom against a freshly seeded database.
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Is the API up and can it reach Oracle?
GET {{api}}/health/ready

### 1. Create a student
# @name createStudent
POST {{api}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test Parent Child",
  "parentContact": "test.parent@example.com",
  "parentPhone": "555-0199",
  "preferredLanguage": "ES"
}

### Capture the id for the calls below
@studentId = {{createStudent.response.body.studentId}}

### 2. Balance starts at zero
GET {{api}}/students/{{studentId}}/balance

### 3. FAILURE CASE -- booking with no hours and no credit.
### Expect 402 Payment Required, title ERR_INSUFFICIENT_HOURS.
POST {{api}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": {{studentId}},
  "startTime": "2026-09-15T10:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 60
}

### 4. Buy a package
POST {{api}}/packages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": {{studentId}},
  "hours": 10,
  "amount": 600,
  "method": "ZELLE"
}

### 5. Balance is now 10
GET {{api}}/students/{{studentId}}/balance

### 6. Book a session -- expect 201 Created
# @name bookSession
POST {{api}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": {{studentId}},
  "startTime": "2026-09-15T10:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 90,
  "notes": "Reading section"
}

@sessionId = {{bookSession.response.body.sessionId}}

### 7. Balance dropped by 1.5 hours -- reserved at booking, not at completion
GET {{api}}/students/{{studentId}}/balance

### 8. FAILURE CASE -- double booking the same slot.
### Expect 409 Conflict, title ERR_DOUBLE_BOOKED.
POST {{api}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": {{studentId}},
  "startTime": "2026-09-15T10:30:00",
  "durationMinutes": 60
}

### 9. FAILURE CASE -- outside business hours.
### Expect 422, title ERR_OUTSIDE_BUSINESS_HOURS.
POST {{api}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": {{studentId}},
  "startTime": "2026-09-15T06:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 60
}

### 10. FAILURE CASE -- a duration off the 15 minute grid.
### Expect 422, title ERR_INVALID_DURATION.
POST {{api}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": {{studentId}},
  "startTime": "2026-09-16T10:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 50
}

### 11. FAILURE CASE -- a start time in the past.
### Expect 422, title ERR_START_IN_PAST.
POST {{api}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": {{studentId}},
  "startTime": "2020-01-01T10:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 60
}

### 12. The week's schedule for the admin calendar
GET {{api}}/sessions?from=2026-09-14&to=2026-09-20

### 13. Cancel outside the 24 hour window -- status CANCELLED, hours returned
DELETE {{api}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}

### 14. Balance is back to 10
GET {{api}}/students/{{studentId}}/balance

### 15. FAILURE CASE -- cancelling twice.
### Expect 409 Conflict, title ERR_INVALID_TRANSITION. This is the check that
### stops the same hours being credited back a second time.
DELETE {{api}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}

### 16. Book again, then complete it
# @name secondBooking
POST {{api}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": {{studentId}},
  "startTime": "2026-09-17T14:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 60
}

@secondSessionId = {{secondBooking.response.body.sessionId}}

### 17. Complete it -- status COMPLETED, hours stay spent
POST {{api}}/sessions/{{secondSessionId}}/complete

### 18. FAILURE CASE -- cancelling a completed session.
### Expect 409 Conflict, title ERR_INVALID_TRANSITION.
DELETE {{api}}/sessions/{{secondSessionId}}

### 19. The parent dashboard read model
GET {{api}}/students/{{studentId}}/dashboard

### 20. Events waiting to reach Service Bus (should drain to 0 within seconds)
GET {{api}}/ops/outbox
X-Ops-Key: local-dev-key

### 21. Queue tomorrow's reminders by hand, the way the timer function does
POST {{api}}/ops/reminders?hoursAhead=24
X-Ops-Key: local-dev-key

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Pay-per-session path
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Record loose cash for a student with no package
POST {{api}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": {{studentId}},
  "amount": 75,
  "method": "VENMO",
  "notes": "single lesson"
}
